WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.184
On a Yuan-dynasty stage, the red curtain slowly opened and a young woman in white stepped out. Tonight's play was a tragedy that would make everyone weep.

00:00:11.534 --> 00:00:18.758
She was Dou E, a kind young woman who was falsely accused of murder.

00:00:19.108 --> 00:00:23.932
She shook her head, saying again and again that she was innocent.

00:00:24.282 --> 00:00:29.850
The officials never looked for the truth and simply sentenced her to death — how unfair it was.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:40.088
At the execution ground, Dou E raised her head to the heavens and made a solemn vow. She believed Heaven would surely prove her innocence.

00:00:40.438 --> 00:00:49.370
She said: if I am innocent, snow must fall heavily in the sixth month. The snow fell harder and harder, as if Heaven itself were weeping for her.

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:59.608
Surely enough, the snow flew thick and fast, proving her innocence; this tragedy has been told for hundreds of years. Even today, people still remember Dou E's story.

